    "text": "<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image7-18d546d5-8449-414d-b121-587773bb3ac8.jpg\"/> <br >Consider a shell of radius r and thickness dr<br > <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math> <br > <math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>   ...(i)<br >Similarly<br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>   ...(ii)<br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>   so  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
